  {
    "field_name": "Main Goal",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Measure sustained FP64 Linpack performance via rocHPL"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Validation Objective",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Validates rocHPL GFLOPS, time-to-solution, and Residual Check: PASSED. Residual FAILED aborts"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Metrics",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "#1: Mean rocSOLVER LU FP64, TFLOPS (sustained_fp64_performance_across_problem_size_n_tflops); #2: Mean rocSOLVER LU time, s (time_to_solution_across_problem_size_n_s); #3: Mean percent of full MI300X FP64 matrix peak (percent_of_gpu_fp64_matrix_peak)"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Tools Executed",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Build scripts/build.sh under hipcc_host_gcc.sh; run mpirun bin/rochpl with CLI --N --NB --P --Q --pfact. HPL.dat is present but is not the control path"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Execution Details and Purpose",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Build and run local bin/rochpl under mpirun --allow-run-as-root for yaml warmup plus timed repeats, parse GFLOPS, time-to-solution, and Residual Check, and abort if Residual Check is not PASSED, to measure sustained FP64 Linpack. Clamp problem_size_N from >=65536 to 32768"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Command Methodology",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Run local FP64 rocHPL (mpirun bin/rochpl) with yaml problem_size_N (smoke 4096, baseline/extended 32768; >=65536 clamped to 32768), block_size, and process grid as CLI flags, repeat solves per timed_repeats, then parse Final Score GFLOPS, time-to-solution, and Residual Check. This is Linpack via rocHPL"
  },
  {
    "field_name": "Execution Description With Parameters",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "Builds local bin/rochpl (rocHPL) with a hipcc GCC pin, then runs mpirun --allow-run-as-root -np num_gpus bin/rochpl with CLI --N --NB --P --Q --pfact. problem_size_N >=65536 is clamped to 32768. num_iterations is capped by timed_repeats (6 at N>=32768 baseline, 16 extended). Residual Check: PASSED is required. Placeholder HPL.dat is rewritten in place and does not drive N/NB/P/Q. The binary is single-GPU rocSOLVER dgetrf and dgetrs at one N. output_format: csv"
  },
  {
